        19
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1",
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.wyomingcarboncounty.com/places-to-visit/dixon"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The historic Dixon Club has served as a watering hole for travelers passing through the valley for generations.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
